KJV: anger, bottles, hot displeasure, furious(-ly, -ry), heat, indignation, poison, rage, wrath(-ful). See H2529 (חֶמְאָה).

H2535.definition:
from H2525 (חָם);
heat; by implication, the sun
KJV: heat, sun.

H2536.definition:
from H2535 (חַמָּה) and H410 (אֵל); anger of God;
Chammuel, an Israelite
KJV: Hamuel.

H2537.definition:
