KJV: Hamutal.

H2538.definition:
from H2550 (חָמַל); pitied;
Chamul, an Israelite
KJV: Hamul.

H2539.definition:
patronymically from H2538 (חָמוּל);
a Chamulite (collectively) or descendants of Chamul
KJV: Hamulites.

H2540.definition:
from H2552 (חָמַם); warm spring;
